4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hM4LPqgvyMYQ7kNvwHAYghP&_nc_oc=AdryRe98qAlBU-cxDT89mcVzxIUd9hFcnLJ3cPckKCtKeyrdz79AdYiorKD-TNX9v9w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af61tum7VXvNDTxjECqGmBZxnX2zVVdvpKDFjh5YcYdtlw&oe=6A09BCD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qTJpfSJx2tkQ7kNvwHnSrqL&_nc_oc=AdrZt8Nzx9zdxDmOBTSkuN_tTxZ3OHQGPx1Kzc9d6bU58HR6E0HZbr4Jo9g2_aUMHT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4_WT40QHvc9MC6SSTy1t8pTJxYT4BC_k0XJgd2H4sCag&oe=6A09C1B2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vONI_gMVlOkQ7kNvwHtkVlw&_nc_oc=AdpF9BPL07ebFyq_m5ywcy_ZTStzfqQ8Y9oO4zAZTg0NNCt2Rx4FD03TLY3ga3Bcom0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7oF_QtHpnpaUfu5yWBGLxr6rAJCd8Ro7qr5MnAQ0FvCA&oe=6A09CF55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p